            "review_title": "Review at Bien Lon Restaurant",
            "review_text": "TooToo H\nHoi An, Vietnam4 contributions\n0\nextremely disappointed\nJul 2019 • Family\nSo disappointed. Went as family of 5 with little kids.\nOrdered total 5 things and 2 beer.\nFrench fries\nFried beef noodle\nA calamari dish\nA shell fish dish \nA Oyster dish. \n\nThe shell fish and oyster came first. We ate them but our kids don't like them so they keep waiting for fries and noodle.\nThe french fried and beef noodle didn't come for a long time. We checked with a English speaking waiter. He confirmed these were ordered.\nThen the calamari dish arrived but was baby squid! We told them it's the wrong dish because there's a picture showing the calamari dish we should receive. They tried really hard to convince us it's the same and it's yummy. We told them we do not want it. They finally gave up and took it back. \nanother 10 or 15 min later the french fried arrived. But the beef noodle never showed up.\nI finally asked the casher to refund the beef noodle then found out it was never ordered despite it was confirmed ordered! We were so up set and decided not to wait and left feeling still hungry. \n\nSo you see, out of 5 dish, they got 2 correctly. 1 wrong, 1 very slow and 1 never showed up.\n\nIn the end, after I arrived back at hotel I found out they charged us 3 beer instead of 2.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten July 21, 2019",
